  <baseType>
    dpage:DocPage
  </baseType>
  <is>
    A website cheat-sheet for type expressions
  </is>
  <documentation>
    Structuring skeleton for the “Type expressions” documentation page. Planned scopes: type expressions, combining named types, type expression cheat-sheet. Purpose and detailLevel are derived from the a01 BmlDocSetPlan PagePlan docs.TypeExpressionsBasics. This skeleton carries page identity, properties, and authoritative-source references only; sections and prose are authored in the a03 stage.
  </documentation>
